cl exports the constructors, destructors and inline members this case defines inside its classes, and cxx1's object does not list them - not because they are absent but because cxx1 keeps a function defined in its class as an ordinary definition where cl puts it in a COMDAT, and the comparison reads only what each object exports. Same root as dynamic-cast.nocl and the .nonames beside this file: this compiler has no weak or linkonce linkage. The operators this case is about resolve and answer the right value, which run-cases.cmd checks on this box.
